From 88a92184115be0dc3ddf886abb622102a88c06d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:57:15 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Preempt no-progress interleave pass; age stale lane ranks

Requests scheduled once and then preempted keep their
last_scheduled_step lane rank, win every lane at step start, and hand
the running chunks only the post-waiting interleave pass, which is
preemption-forbidden; at free == 0 the engine spins on empty steps
forever. The lane aging for the never-scheduled cohort does not cover
this case because the rank is set.

Two changes, both scheduler-side:

1. The post-waiting interleave pass now allows preemption on a step
   that scheduled nothing (allow_preemption=not num_scheduled_tokens,
   mirroring the boundary-logits release and decode-refill fallbacks),
   so a starved chunk can preempt the last running request, free its
   blocks, and produce a forward. Preempting a request with in-flight
   connector jobs routes the store/load flush into an unbounded
   worker-side wait() (a hard hang), so preemption is allowed only
   while the connector is quiescent: has_pending_push_work() is False
   exactly when the scheduler connector holds no transfer jobs and the
   tier manager reports no pending work.

2. _lane_rank ages the scheduled cohort: a candidate whose
   last_scheduled_step is more than LANE_AGING_STEPS steps behind the
   current step ranks stale (current_step), rotating behind every
   recently-scheduled candidate regardless of the rank being set.
   Deterministic, bounded, no env knobs; progressing requests refresh
   their rank via record_scheduled. This is the recovery path while
   the connector is non-quiescent and the second-pass preemption is
   guarded.

Regression tests: tests/v1/core/test_prefill_lane_livelock.py
(test_preempted_after_scheduled_cohort_cannot_starve_runnable_chunks,
test_busy_connector_guards_preemption_and_aging_recovers). The
never-admissible-cohort case now holds the connector non-quiescent so
aging remains its isolated recovery mechanism.
---
 tests/v1/core/test_prefill_lane_livelock.py | 197 +++++++++++++++++++-
 vllm/v1/core/sched/prefill_interleave.py    |  15 +-
 vllm/v1/core/sched/scheduler.py             |  16 +-
 3 files changed, 216 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

